---
title: Grade Decision Tree (Boundary-Explicit)
---
flowchart TD
    Start([Start]) --> V{Is score in<br/>range 0–100?}
    V -->|No| Err[Raise ValueError]
    V -->|Yes| B1{score >= 80?}
    B1 -->|Yes| A[Return 'A']
    B1 -->|No| B2{score >= 70?}
    B2 -->|Yes| GB[Return 'B']
    B2 -->|No| B3{score >= 60?}
    B3 -->|Yes| GC[Return 'C']
    B3 -->|No| B4{score >= 50?}
    B4 -->|Yes| GD[Return 'D']
    B4 -->|No| GF[Return 'F']

    classDef startEnd fill:#3776ab,stroke:#1e4870,color:#ffffff,stroke-width:2px
    classDef cond fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#f59e0b,color:#1a1410
    classDef result fill:#d1fae5,stroke:#10b981,color:#064e3b
    classDef error fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#ef4444,color:#7f1d1d
    class Start startEnd
    class V,B1,B2,B3,B4 cond
    class A,GB,GC,GD,GF result
    class Err error
